ose reachability you dont control.\nIf you release a game and this file suddenly is no longer available for any reason, your game will become unplayable. I would recommend to download the model and reupload it to some location you control.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2754805122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2754838757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104651#issuecomment-2754838757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104651","id":2754838757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kM4Dl","user":{"login":"yankscally","id":27631913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NjMxOTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27631913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally","html_url":"https://github.com/yankscally","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yankscally/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T15:30:31Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T15:40:37Z","body":">i would still recommend against using an url whose reachability you dont control.\n\nSorry @MarianoGnu , I should have said in the report, I'm working on a 3D asset library addon for godot where you can download models into your project. \nThe gallery I am helping uses archive.org links to download the assets. \n\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2754838757/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2754840342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104651#issuecomment-2754840342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104651","id":2754840342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kM4cW","user":{"login":"Swarkin","id":102416174,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhq_Lg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102416174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin","html_url":"https://github.com/Swarkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Swarkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T15:30:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T15:36:39Z","body":"Weirdly, this happens only when:\n- requesting the original url that gives a redirect (`https://web.archive.org/web/https://poly.googleusercontent.com/downloads/c/fp/1623061107783986/9L2Lt-sxzdp/9CCR_YwpE17/model.gl